    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d51">

                <pb facs="0081" n="69" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg69"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">875.01/11–1245: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Representative in Albania</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Fultz</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tirana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-11-12T12:00:00+01:00">November 12,
                            1945—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received November 12—10:55 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>191. Text US note recognition delivered 1130 hours November 12. General Hoxha
                    stated Govt archives looted and burned prior liberation Tirana. No copies
                    treaties between US and Albania available. Unable to give reply US note until
                    existing treaties can be reviewed. Hoxha urgently requests that copies be
                    forwarded by you at earliest and advise when these can be expected arrive
                    here.</p>
                <p>Sent Dept as 191; repeated to Rome as 15 and to Bern for Jacobs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fultz</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
